From 43cedf8381d02dad6641c2434cad13b58fcbc136 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 26 Aug 2026 21:27:18 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] airoha: refactor scu map and rename en75xx to econet

Signed-off-by: Matheus Sampaio Queiroga <srherobrine20@gmail.com>
OpenWrt: omit deletion of the obsolete DDR blob, which is not shipped in
this patch series. The final U-Boot tree uses external early-boot tooling.
